{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51635","headline":"赋山别诸知己 · 锺蒨","name":"赋山别诸知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮景江亭上，云山日望多。\n只愁[辞]（解）辇毂，长恨隔嵯峨。\n有意图功业，无心忆薜萝。\n亲朋将远别，且共醉笙歌。\n（《徐铉集》三。\n又《全五代诗》二九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"锺蒨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}